    "Name": "Cyclops C",
    "Details": "Sheathed in hardened armor, the Cyclops C is a bit slower but much tougher than its forebears. A token but efficient weapons array exists merely to protect the 'Mech's sophisticated communications equipment. A powerful force multiplier, the Cyclops C has been issued to Dominion PGCs, with a focus on Phalanxes to improve unit coordination. The simple, rugged 'Mech is an attractive alternative to the Clan's more advanced offerings.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Battle Computer B2000</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.22</color></b>",
